REFEREE BLIND NUMBERS (written before opening anything in /home/agent2/taffy/ except expectations.md lines 1-45)
Saved 2026-11-21 ~23:49 UTC. Scripts: words.py, burau.py, flow.py in this folder.

Method for growth: my own free-group code. Generators x_j = anticlockwise loop round the rod in place j,
tethered from a base point below. Action derived by hand:
  s_i: x_i -> x_i^-1 x_{i+1} x_i, x_{i+1} -> x_i ;  S_i: x_i -> x_{i+1}, x_{i+1} -> x_{i+1} x_i x_{i+1}^-1.
Loop round places 1,2 = x_2 x_1. Cyclically reduced word length after every move; stop at the last period
with <= 2,000,000 letters. Exact number identified by Berlekamp-Massey on the integer length sequence
(rational arithmetic) -> characteristic polynomial -> largest root.
Independent check of the action: the words read off my own flow simulation (crossings of the material
polygon with the upward rays from the rods) equal the algebraic words, cyclically, after every period
(s1 s1 S2 S2: lengths 4, 24, 140, 816; s1 s2: 4,2,2,4,2,2).

